  "rule": "A pocol_getHeaders reply is acted on only if it is a JSON-RPC 2.0 object with exactly one of result/error (P-C32-1). An error with integral code -32021 and string message must carry data {reason: 'busy' | 'rate', retryAfterMs: integral number} with 250 <= ms <= 2000 for busy (network.md:234) and 0 <= ms <= 2000 for rate (P-C32-2). Integral means the accepted C19 value semantics: finite, integral, never boolean or string (P-C32-3). A valid -32021 is retried after exactly retryAfterMs, at most 3 times (browser.md:41). Anything else ends the check with viewIncomplete, no frame, 4901 for pending account/sign requests, no wait and no exception. NaN/Infinity tokens are rejected by the strict parser (P-C32-4).",
